OL,3,GNEWSAWe need more peace, says
OL,4,A105-year-old WW2 veteran
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a Royal Air Force (RAF) rear gunner
OL,7,Fduring World War Two, Ronnie Holdsworth
OL,8,Fwas considered lucky to have survived
OL,9,Fmore than three bombing raids.
OL,11,FRemarkably, the Bradford-born
OL,12,F105-year-old went on to complete more
OL,13,Fthan 30 missions and now lives a
OL,14,Fpeaceful life in a retirement village
OL,15,Fin California.
OL,17,FHe is unable to travel from the United
OL,18,FStates to the UK, so his family took
OL,19,FRemembrance Sunday to him - along with
OL,20,Fan RAF uniform for him to wear.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
