OL,3,GNEWSAWe need more peace, says
OL,4,A105-year-old WW2 veteran
OL,5,
OL,6,FRonnie said: "The guys that are left
OL,7,Fremember what happened and we don't
OL,8,Fwant it to happen again. We need more
OL,9,Fpeace."
